# Academic Planner — Cline Agent Rules & Architecture Guide

Welcome to the **Academic Planner & Attendance Tracker** codebase. This file serves as your persistent memory, operational protocol, and technical specification. Always follow these rules when developing or modifying this repository.

---

## 1. Project Overview & Hosting
* **Type**: Progressive Web App (PWA) built with Vanilla JavaScript, HTML5, and responsive CSS.
* **Production URL**: [https://academic-planner-eight.vercel.app](https://academic-planner-eight.vercel.app)
* **Git Remote**: `https://github.com/parikhniket655/Academic-Planner.git` (Branch: `main`)
* **Deployment**: Continuous Deployment via Vercel — any commit pushed to `origin/main` is automatically built and deployed live within seconds.

---

## 2. Core Repository Files
* **`index.html`**: Single-Page Application (SPA) DOM structure, tabs (Today/Attendance, Timetable, Dashboard, Analytics, Mess, Settings), and modals.
* **`app.js`**: Core business logic, timetable filtering, state management, attendance graph engine, and Supabase integration.
* **`styles.css`**: Complete responsive stylesheet, dark theme default, timetable grid, and status badges.
* **`sw.js`**: Service Worker managing offline asset caching and PWA installs.
* **`manifest.json`**: Web app metadata and PWA icons.
* **`term5_default_timetable.json`**: Pre-seeded verified Term V schedule fallback.
* **`student_db.json`**: Directory of students, emails, rolls, and default section assignments.
* **`supabase_sync_script.js`**: Google Apps Script that syncs the live administration Google Sheet to Supabase.
* **`mess_menu.csv`**: Monthly student mess schedule.

---

## 3. MANDATORY RULE: PWA Cache Invalidation
Because this application is a PWA with a Service Worker, browsers aggressively cache JavaScript and stylesheets. **Whenever you modify `app.js` or `styles.css`**, you **MUST** bump the cache version across all three of these locations:

1. **`app.js`**: Update `TIMETABLE_CACHE_VERSION`:
   ```javascript
   const TIMETABLE_CACHE_VERSION = "v<INCREMENT>";
   ```
2. **`sw.js`**: Update `CACHE_NAME`:
   ```javascript
   const CACHE_NAME = "iimr-tracker-cache-v<INCREMENT>";
   ```
3. **`index.html`**: Update the script tag query parameter:
   ```html
   <script src="app.js?v=<YYYYMMDD>v<INCREMENT>"></script>
   ```

*(Current active version: `v826`)*.

