## 5. Timetable Data & Sync Pipeline
The application uses a multi-tier fallback architecture:
1. **Direct Supabase REST API**: Fetches live sessions synced from Google Sheets (`date_key >= 2026-09-12`).
2. **Google Sheets Web App Endpoint**: Direct fallback to `TIMETABLE_SHEETS_URL` (`https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbyMlI_uymfSGLsvDLXg9SdyrZ_gCWQkqSissJr9OQe3NUI6KN6Z1wzkOx0aScMxP-xCgw/exec`).
3. **Local Storage / IndexedDB**: Caches timetable on student devices for instant offline access.
4. **Pre-Bundled Fallback**: `DEFAULT_TIMETABLE` loaded from `term5_default_timetable.json`.

