## 7. Development & Deployment Workflow
1. When asked to make updates, inspect existing code and styles first.
2. Maintain documentation integrity and clean syntax.
3. Bump cache version across `app.js`, `sw.js`, and `index.html`.
4. Commit and push:
   ```bash
   git add <files>
   git commit -m "<Clear, descriptive message>"
   git push origin main
   ```
5. Confirm live status on `academic-planner-eight.vercel.app`.
